BT 1 0 0 1 0 55.2 Tm .854188 Tw 16.6 TL /F3 11.2 Tf .160784 .160784 .160784 rg (I have read about thinkers who questioned the world before me, but I live in a world shaped by my) Tj T* 0 Tw .963265 Tw (own generation. We are surrounded by information, opinions, trends, expectations, and the constant) Tj T* 0 Tw .718456 Tw (presence of social media. We can encounter more perspectives than ever, yet ) Tj /F2 11.2 Tf (access to information) Tj T* 0 Tw (does not automatically mean that we have examined it carefully.) Tj T* ET
