BT 1 0 0 1 0 71.8 Tm /F3 11.2 Tf 16.6 TL 1.044281 Tw (I find myself wondering what it means to think independently in a world that is always offering us) Tj T* 0 Tw .403256 Tw (something to believe, desire, imitate, or become. Even the wish to be different deserves examination:) Tj T* 0 Tw .569286 Tw (is it truly my own, or has it been shaped by the same world I want to question? I do not have a final) Tj T* 0 Tw .714211 Tw (answer. I am only beginning to ask what it means to live consciously, rather than simply move with) Tj T* 0 Tw (everything around me.) Tj T* ET
